## How `prime` calibrates each role

`/prime <role> [issue-id|mr-url]` injects:

1. The role file (responsibilities, boundaries, output format, handoff rules)
2. Project schema from `CLAUDE.md`
3. Live state — open assigned issues for this role, MRs awaiting review, recent wiki MRs (via {{TRACKER_TYPE}} adapter)
4. Repo-specific `CLAUDE.md` if invoked inside a target repo

See `.claude/skills/prime/SKILL.md` for invocation details.
